            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.16+NUM.28.17+NUM.28.18+NUM.28.19+NUM.28.20+NUM.28.21+NUM.28.22+NUM.28.23+NUM.28.24+NUM.28.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 28.16-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Khola e pasaka Khulwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe. Kikhole mu mwesi kwa Abibu, sikila siaba siilo mu mwesi okwo nikwo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amureeseliamo enywe mwarura e Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cha abuundu niio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alirobora khulwe khusaayilao mala okhonyeleo lilala khu makheese kowo namwe ekhaafu khulwe embosio eye Pasaka ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhalia embosio eyo ne kimikaati kiilimo limela tawe. Chindaalo saba mulalia kimikaati kikhalimo limela tawe, sikila mwarura mu sibala sia Misiri khangu. Lia kimikaati kino, nio mu bulamu bwenywe bwoosi mukhebulile endaalo niyo mwarurirakho e Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chindaalo saba se aliio omundu yesi yesi mu sibala sienywe olaba ne kamamela tawe. Ne enyama eye embosio niio muaana ekolooba khu ndaalo eye khunyoa ekhoya eliibwe yoosi siilo esio, ekharama khukhwola kumutikhinyi tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mukhaanila embosio eye Epasaka mu lukoba lwosi lwosi mu ngoba nicho Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe alikho amuelesia enywe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali kiaanile abuundu niio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alirobora, khumusaayilao. Abwenao muaanileo embosio ekolooba, a siise nisio mwaruriramo e Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teekha enyama mala mukiliile abuundu alala niio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi arobora e khusaayilao. Oli kumutikhinyi ne mukobola mu mu maeema kenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwe chindaalo sita chiloondakho mulia kumukaati kuukhalimo limela tawe ne kakhali khu ndaalo ekhola saba buusiana alala Khulwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe. Ne mukhakhola kimilimo khu ndaalo eyo tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
