              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli lwosi khola kaali ng'ali, nio mumenye lundi mube mu sibala nimwo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe alikho amuelesia enywe.",
          "type": "text",
